\chapter{STME-RS-A Engineering Architecture Overview}

\section{Integrated System Design}

The STME-RS-A propulsion system integrates high-performance numerical
simulation, real-time hardware control, and geometric–plasma coupling
mechanisms into a unified architecture. The system is designed to operate
under extreme thermal, magnetic, and mechanical loads while maintaining
topological invariant stability.

