\section{Core Orchestrator}

The orchestrator coordinates solver execution, hardware control loops,
and telemetry synchronization. It exposes a minimal interface:

\begin{itemize}
\item initialize\_subsystems()
\item execute\_run\_cycle(overpressure\_factor)
\item emergency\_shutdown()
\end{itemize}

\section{Numerical Solver Stack}

The solver suite includes:

\begin{itemize}
\item Stiff Navier–Stokes solver
\item Finite-rate chemistry module
\item RMHD-compatible vorticity evolution
\end{itemize}

Residual norms converge under deterministic C++20 parallel execution.

